Create a modern dashboard.

The dashboard should display:

```text
Total Employees
Present Today
Absent Today
Late Today
On Leave
Working Remotely
Overtime
Pending Approvals
```

Include charts:

* Attendance trend
* Present vs absent
* Late arrival trend
* Department attendance
* Leave trend
* Overtime trend

Dashboard should support date filters.

Example:

```text
Today
Yesterday
This Week
This Month
Custom Range
```

