# 50. ADMIN SETTINGS

Create centralized settings.

Examples:

```text
Company Settings
Attendance Settings
Shift Settings
Leave Settings
Notification Settings
Security Settings
Payroll Settings
Subscription Settings
```

Settings should be tenant-specific where appropriate.

